ree.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Integration Ecosystem</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 font-sans antialiased text-zinc-100\">\n\n    <!-- Main Card Container -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] h-[800px] max-h-[90vh] bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 rounded-[2rem] shadow-[0_25px_50px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),inset_0_-2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col border border-zinc-700/50\">\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <header class=\"pt-16 flex flex-col items-center relative z-20 px-6 text-center\">\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-600/50 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700 to-zinc-800 shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12),inset_0_-1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-b from-rose-500 to-rose-600 text-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-rose-400/50\">\n                    <iconify-ico